<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 13/14.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 13/14.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>13/14. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 13/14	  June 12/13</p>
<p> CZK	0.42769	     0.42818</p>
<p> DKK	2.10135	     2.10149</p>
<p> FIM	2.6689		2.66533</p>
<p> HUF	0.07472	     0.0747</p>
<p> JPY	0.12096	     0.12079</p>
<p> LTL	3.45894	     3.44938</p>
<p> LVL     24.23828	    24.13785</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024		0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.77581	     1.77336</p>
<p> UAH	7.45969	     7.4405</p>
<p> USD     13.834		13.7984</p>
<p> XEU     15.60683	    15.59564</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
